    "title": "Fort Wayne man accused of molesting 5-year-old girl arrested - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Corryn Brock ,\n4 hours ago FORT WAYNE, Ind. (WPTA) - A 51-year-old Fort Wayne man accused of molesting a 5-year-old girl was arrested Wednesday. George Mack is charged with three counts of child molesting and one count of performing sexual conduct in the presence of the minor. The charges carry a potential prison sentence of up to nearly 100 years. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 13",
